caption: Reference
title: $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-references/docs/type

! Summary
A reference is supporting material attached to a project: any tiddler tagged `$:/GSD/Reference`.

! Detail

!! Field Variables

| !Field | !Values | !Note |
|gsd_project |''user-defined'' |Project the reference belongs to |

References appear in the project view's References section and on the References dashboard (groupable by any [[GroupBy|Grouping dimensions]] dimension and sortable by any [[SortBy|Sorting dimensions]] expression via the list's strip). Grouped headings link to the project; ungrouped rows carry the jump-to-project icon instead (tooltip = project title). Both surfaces create references via the shared `<<new-reference-button>>` component (`ui/components/new-reference-button.tid` — the project page pre-fills project and realm, the dashboard passes neither).

! Best Practice
Create references from a project's page (`<<new-reference-button>>`) so `gsd_project` is pre-filled.